#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/galliumos.md:0
msgid ""
"Learn how to install the snapd package on GalliumOS through the Synaptic "
"package manager or from Xfce Terminal using standard APT commands."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/galliumos.md:8
msgid "Install snap on GalliumOS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/galliumos.md:10
msgid ""
"Snap can be installed from the *Synaptic* package manager, found in the "
"*System* menu. Simply search for *snapd* and install the snapd package from "
"the list of results."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/galliumos.md:12
msgid "Install from the command line"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/galliumos.md:14
msgid ""
"Snap can also be installed from the command line. Open *Xfce Terminal* from "
"the panel and enter the following:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/galliumos.md:16
msgid ""
"sudo apt update\n"
"sudo apt install snapd\n"
msgstr ""
